1&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gbsUbjaugsEQ7kNvwFhRkQ4&_nc_oc=AdplMyWdmjlyiTZSEc10I8BotybQxeRMUUtGCTgys8nkQmAPEzN3NGnDWmkFdEsfpzA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGmcVPXq1Dr4CoRIZVZ1KsUymOtTCBbZxOn1GAPYETv6w&oe=6A7B123C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverImageLandscape1.png", "id": "2437183346774056", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622276_2437183350107389_575708754879884824_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y1dwsjUnQIwQ7kNvwFZJazG&_nc_oc=Adrv-s5fKx1RIwjDEbb-uamSQanjaNhXxrPOoIk-mGmyLfijYde1wTQG_UNOwI17e8Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHgc5zXPf7SRQ-ythAzXvXtTkJgnp7Wp-ubq7c53Ih6VA&oe=6A7B147B"}, "display_name": "Raider Legends", "keywords": ["cooperative", "fantasy", "multiplayer", "gorilla", "loot"], "long_description": "**Welcome to Camp**\n\nYou've arrived just in time.\n\nAround here, there's always another Rift on the horizon.\n\nStep inside, conquer the challenge, bring home better loot, become stronger... then do it all again.\n\n{2505685783194274}\n\nRest while you can.\n\nIt won't be long before you're heading back out.\n\n{2931613547335456}\n\nOne last thing...\n\nEvery week brings something new.\n\nNew places.\n\nNew gear.\n\nNew trouble.\n\n{2726092177792254}\n\nIf you've got ideas, or just want to swap stories, come find us in the Raider Legends Discord:\n\n**https://discord.gg/AbjjjcSgyG**\n\nSee you around, kid.\n\n\u2014 Gawk", "short_description": "Team up with friends, conquer ever-changing adventures, discover powerful loot, and become stronger with every run. There's always another Rift waiting."}]}, "developer_name": "Gun Raiders Entertainment Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gunraiders.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://gunraiders.com/terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Gun Raiders Entertainment Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://gunraiders.